# Participant material must never enter Git, on any branch.
# Policy: docs/participant-material-policy.md
#
# This is a safety net, not the control. The control is the checklist in
# CONTRIBUTING.md and not putting such files in the working tree at all.
# A pattern here only stops an accident; it cannot stop a deliberate `git add -f`.

# Transcripts and caption formats
transcripts/
**/transcripts/
*transcript*
*.vtt
*.srt
*.sbv
*.ttml

# Internal working material that is not for publication
participant-data/
judging-notes/
curation-notes/
submissions/

# Archives dropped into the tree while working
*.zip
*.tar.gz

# The policy document itself names the thing it governs, so keep it tracked.
!docs/participant-material-policy.md
